---
const stats = [
  { value: '120K', label: 'monthly listeners' },
  { value: '80+',  label: 'live shows' },
  { value: '12',   label: 'countries reached' },
];
---

<section id="bio" class="section bio" aria-labelledby="bio-heading">
  <div class="section__inner bio__inner">

    <div class="bio__text">
      <p class="bio__short" id="bio-heading">
        mento makes music for the restless. Somewhere between post-punk and
        slow-burning shoegaze, their songs feel like cities at 3am — familiar
        and a little dangerous.
      </p>

      <details class="bio__extended">
        <summary class="bio__extended-toggle">Read more</summary>
        <div class="bio__extended-body">
          <p>
            Formed in 2019, mento spent their first two years playing
            underground venues and recording in a basement studio they built
            themselves. Their debut EP <em>Espejo</em> (2021) spread quietly
            through online communities before landing on editorial playlists
            across Europe and South America.
          </p>
          <p>
            Their sound draws from the tension between control and release —
            tight, precise arrangements that suddenly give way to walls of
            reverb-drenched guitar. The result is music that rewards patience
            and punishes distraction.
          </p>
          <p>
            In 2023 they released <em>Noche Larga</em>, their first full-length,
            recorded live to tape over five days. It charted independently in
            five countries.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>

    <ul class="bio__stats" aria-label="Band statistics">
      {stats.map(({ value, label }) => (
        <li class="bio__stat">
          <span class="bio__stat-value" data-count-to={value}>{value}</span>
          <span class="bio__stat-label">{label}</span>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .bio__inner {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-lg);

    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      align-items: start;
    }
  }

  .bio__short {
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.5rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
  }

  .bio__extended {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
  }

  .bio__extended-toggle {
    cursor: pointer;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    list-style: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
    border: none;
    background: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .bio__extended-toggle::after {
    content: '↓';
    display: inline-block;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .bio__extended[open] .bio__extended-toggle::after {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }

  .bio__extended-body {
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    color: var(--color-text);
    opacity: 0.8;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .bio__extended-body {
      animation: fade-in 0.3s ease;
    }
  }

  @keyframes fade-in {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-8px); }
    to   { opacity: 0.8; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  .bio__stats {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);

    @media (min-width: 480px) and (max-width: 767px) {
      flex-direction: row;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
  }

  .bio__stat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .bio__stat-value {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-text);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .bio__stat-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
</style>
